ason, and his life, in jeopardy.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Ice Road Truckers","released":"2026-11-28T12:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:00:00Z","overview":"On the Dalton, everyone is gunning to be the new haul road ace, but Darrell's plan is derailed by a massive wreck that calls into question his reasons for being in Alaska.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Ice Road Truckers","released":"2026-11-28T13:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","overview":"On the Dalton, Austin's trying to prove himself in a heavy haul convoy, but pushing the 100-ton modular building through blowing snow leads to a rookie mistake that threatens the entire mission.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Ax Men: The Log and Winding Road","released":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","overview":"In Louisiana, Shelby and his assistant Bob head out looking for logs on his newly repaired two-ton swamp buggy. In Central Florida, the Chapman crew goes to battle against the legendary \"Gump\" log - the biggest challenge of their career.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Ax Men: Swamp Man Boogie","released":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","overview":"Deep in the Bayou, Shelby hits Lake Ponchartrain with Belinda and Bob to retrieve a massive log he marked years ago. In Florida, it's round two between Chapman and the legendary Gump log.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Ax Men: Teepee of Death","released":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:00:00Z","overview":"In Washington, Rygaard's remaining veterans go old school to keep the team on track. Deep in the Bayou, Shelby and Bob discover a valuable sinker cypress, but reeling it in is easier said then done.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Ax Men: Old Log New Tricks","released":"2026-11-28T17:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:00:00Z","overview":"In the Louisiana Bayou, Shelby Stanga's jet boat is in desperate need of repair and he needs to find logs to buy a new engine.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Ax Men: All's Fair in Loggin' War","released":"2026-11-28T18:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:00:00Z","overview":"Down in the swamps of Louisiana, Shelby Stanga is trying to upgrade his logging empire, so he takes a risk and tries out some new equipment.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Ax Men: Don't Cross the Boss","released":"2026-11-28T19:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T19:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:00:00Z","overview":"In the Pacific Northwest, Rygaard logging has begun to claw its way back up the log count thanks to DJ Jeremiah, but today he's a no show.","genres":["Series","Reality"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Duck Dynasty: Shot Thru The Heart","released":"2026-11-28T20:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T20:30:00Z","overview":"The guys learn from Willie that John Luke is going through his first break up. In order to make him feel better the men decide to take John Luke hunting for nutria, and impart their relationship wisdom.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Duck Dynasty: Here Lizard, Lizard","released":"2026-11-28T20:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T20:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T21:00:00Z","overview":"When the warehouse guys new office pet (a lizard) escapes, they try all they can in order to catch the wily reptile. Proving impossible, the guys finally decide to bring in the big guns to help trap it--Mr. Phil Robertson.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human 