st his wedding ring long ago, Missy decides it's time for Jase to replace it with a new one. When Jase is duck hunting, once again, he loses the ring.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Duck Dynasty: Bass Man Standing","released":"2026-11-28T23:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T23:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","overview":"The Duck Commander team is invited to unveil a wing of the local Bass Pro shop that will feature their products.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Duck Dynasty: Si-amese Twins","released":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T00:30:00Z","overview":"Willie calls the team into work on a Saturday afternoon for an HR training session, but the seminar quickly dissolves from unproductive to complete disaster.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Duck Dynasty: Battle of the Brothers","released":"2026-11-29T00:30:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T00:30:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T01:00:00Z","overview":"Willie's suspicious behavior from dying his beard to buying a new motorcycle, makes Jase come to the conclusion that Willie is having a mid-life crisis.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Duck Dynasty: Aloha, Robertsons!","released":"2026-11-29T01:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T01:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T02:00:00Z","overview":"After all their hard work, Willie decides to take the entire Robertson clan on a family vacation to Hawaii. But Willie's daily itinerary for the trip gets constantly undermined by the family's desire to participate in their own island activities.","genres":["Series","Reality","Human Interest"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us","title":"Tough Jobs – Live","released":"2026-11-29T02:00:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-29T02:00:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-29T03:00:00Z","genres":["Entertainment"]},{"id":"ftv_ToughJobs_us